/**
 * Pagination correctness under concurrent deletes.
 *
 * Scenario (identical in both tests):
 *   - Feed of 60 posts, ids 1..60.
 *   - Client fetches page 1: limit 20  => sees ids 1..20.
 *   - 5 EARLY posts are deleted (ids 3..7).
